Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, we're running low on résumés over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，我们这边 只剩几张履历表了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you really want a job with Popular Mechanics?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的想去 《大众机械杂志》做事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if you're gonna work for mechanics, those are the ones to work for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是想为机械工做点事 那倒是不错的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:26.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, look, you guys. I'm going for anything here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:26.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的，我现在 什么都可以做了，好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't be a waitress anymore. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想再当服务生了，真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sick of the lousy tips. I'm sick of being called "Excuse Me."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小费那么少，烦死了 而且大家都叫我〝不好意思〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, did you proofread these?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，你写完后 有没有检查
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有啊，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, nothing. I'm sure they'll be impressed with your excellent "compuper" skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么，你优秀的电〝恼〞能力 我相信大家都会印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.73,0:00:47.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.73,0:00:47.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, do you think it's on all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每一张上面都写这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:56.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, I'm sure the Xerox machine caught a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:56.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会啦，我相信影印机 一定帮你抓到几个错误了
