Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:21.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:21.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I can't believe you. Linda is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不敢相信 琳达这么可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why won't you go out with her again? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你为什么不约她出去  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this still about her whole...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是不是还在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:30.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}..."The Flintstones could have really happened" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:30.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说的〝《摩登原始人》 有可能是真的〞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just, I want someone who does something for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想要一个 能让我心动…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know, who gets my heart pounding...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我小鹿乱撞…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who makes me, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:45.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little play things with yarn?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:45.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身上穿毛衣的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:48.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:48.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:50.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you want her more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:50.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有人更让你心动的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who? Dee, the sarcastic sister from What's Happening!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有谁 就是肥皂剧里 那个女生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:06.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I am totally, totally over her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:06.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的，我对她 完全没有感觉了，好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I just... Hi. - Hi. Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我只是…嘿 - 嘿，还要咖啡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, we're fine. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不了，这样就好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们什么都没说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Uh, Joey cried last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么啊  - 乔伊昨晚哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were playing poker, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不是在玩牌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was chocolate on the three. It looked like an eight, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}3号牌上有巧克力 所以看起来像8好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:34.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, you should've seen him. "Read them and weep."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:34.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该让你们看看 《看着看着就哭了》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:36.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:36.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他也照办了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:41.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now, how come you guys have never played poker with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:41.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们怎么从来不跟我们玩牌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:43.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, what is that? Like some kind of guy thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:43.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊，怎么回事  就是只有男生能玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like some kind of sexist guy thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是只有性别歧视的 男生能玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like, it's poker, so only guys can play?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}扑克牌只有男生能玩啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Women are welcome to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们也很欢迎女生玩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay, so then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，那怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:55.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some kind of, you know, like, some kind of, you know, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:55.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是…就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，到底是怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:01.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There just don't happen to be any women in our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:01.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就只是刚好我们玩牌时 没有女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:05.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we just don't happen to know any women that know how to play poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:05.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊，我们不认识 会玩扑克牌的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:09.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please. That is such a lame excuse. I mean, it's a typical guy response.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:09.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，烂藉口 标准的男生答案
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, do any of you know how to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思，你们当中 有人会玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:15.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you could teach us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:15.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你们可以教我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:26.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so now we draw cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:26.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，现在我们抽牌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:32.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I wouldn't need any, right? Because I have a straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:32.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这样不需要再抽了吧？ 我有顺子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:34.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, good for you. - Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:34.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 太好了 - 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Pheebs, how many do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，菲比 你要几张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:44.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I just need two. The 10 of spades and the six of clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:44.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要两张 黑桃10跟梅花6
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:48.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, uh, Pheebs, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:48.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行，菲比，不可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have the 10 of spades. Here, you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有黑桃10，你要不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, no, see, uh, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行，不可以这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. That's okay. I don't need them. I'm going for fours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系，我不需要这张牌 我要四张四
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊，你在…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've got salmon roulettes and assorted crudités.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是鲑鱼轮盘跟什锦生菜棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:11.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Monica, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:11.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡  你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:15.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a poker game. You can't serve food with more than one syllable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:15.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在玩扑克牌 只能吃垃圾零食
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's got to be like chips or dip or pretz...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像洋芋片、蘸酱、蝴蝶脆饼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:23.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so at this point, the dealer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:23.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，现在庄家…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:27.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? We got it. We got it. Let's play for real. High stakes. Big bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:27.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好了，我们会了 开始玩真的吧，高风险、玩真钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, now, you sure? Phoebe just threw away two jacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定吗？ 菲比刚丢出两张杰克…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because they didn't look happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为它们看起来很不快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:39.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm ready. So just deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:39.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我可以玩了 发牌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, all right, last minute lesson. Last minute lesson. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，最后一课 最后一课，乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:43.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:43.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight, three. All right. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}8, 3  好，可以开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it, damn it, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死，该死，该死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. So then, um, you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道了，原来你是在说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- About what? - About how good your cards were.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 说什么谎  - 说你的牌有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. I was bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那叫做唬人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:05.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aha. And what is "bluffing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:05.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那〝唬人〞是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:10.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it not another word for lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:10.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不就是说谎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, sorry to break up this party...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，很抱歉要终止这场派对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:15.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I've got résumés to fax before work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:15.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我得在明天上班前 把履历表发出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Whoa, whoa, whoa. - Rach, we've got to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，瑞秋，我们得定局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Settle what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}定什么局？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Jamestown colony of Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为维吉尼亚州 詹姆士镇的殖民地下定局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, King George is giving us the land, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那块地是乔治国王要给我们的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The game, Rachel. The game. You owe us money for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，这场牌局 这局你欠我们钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what, guys? It's their first time. Why don't we forget about the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧，这是她们第一次玩牌 我们就算了 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:41.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hell, no. We'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:41.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不要，我们会付的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Monica, I had another answer all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，摩妮卡 我已经准备好另一个答案
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:50.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We want a rematch. - Well, that's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:50.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们再来一场 - 我没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could use the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:57.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, basically, you get your ya-yas by taking money from all of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基本上，你们就是 靠从朋友那边赢钱来过瘾的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. - Yes, and I get my ya-yas from lkea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没错 - 对，我靠上宜家过瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:07.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to put them together yourself, but they cost a little less.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:07.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家具得自己组装 但是便宜一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Rachel, this is poker. I play to win, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，我玩扑克牌的目的 就是想赢，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In order for me to win, other people have to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要赢，别人就得输
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if you're gonna play poker with me, don't expect me to be a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要跟我玩扑克牌 就别指望我当好好先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, because once those cards are dealt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为一发牌…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就不是好好先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, boys. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，大家来吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, did you get that from the "I Love Rachel" pizzeria?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在〝我爱瑞秋〞披萨店买的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:51.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You still on that? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:51.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你还在想那个  - 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was with that whole Black Bart speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那场〝我是坏男人〞演讲 是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"When I play poker, I'm not a nice guy".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我一玩扑克牌 就不是好好先生〞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:07:59.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're way off, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:07:59.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄，完全搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't think so. See, Ross, because I think you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可不这么认为 罗斯，我认为你爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, I might have had feelings for her at one time. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对她有过好感，那都过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just... Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是…马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:15.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are you going with that disk? You are not putting that on again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:15.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你拿那片CD干什么  不可以再放了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:20.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcel... Okay. If you press that button, you are in very, very big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:20.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔…好 敢按下那个键，你就完蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You believe what a jerk Ross was being?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:37.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信 罗斯居然那么浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I know. He can get really competitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊，他还真是好胜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. "Hello, Kettle, this is Monica. You're black."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，你是五十步笑百步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not as bad as Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有像罗斯那么糟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:59.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I beg to differ. The Pictionary incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:59.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，我看不出差别 记得比手画脚事件吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was not an incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是什么事件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was gesturing and the plate slipped out of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正在比手画脚 盘子就溜出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:07.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:07.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh! I got an interview. I got an interview. - You're kidding. Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我有面试，我有面试了 - 真的吗？哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Saks Fifth Avenue. - Oh, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:18.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 萨克斯百货公司，第五大街 - 哇，瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:22.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's like the mother ship is calling you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:22.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就好像母船来召你回家乡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:29.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, what's the job? - Assistant buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:29.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是什么样的职位  - 助理采购人员
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! I would be shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以靠血拼…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look. That's Aunt Iris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，爱瑞丝阿姨来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This woman has been playing poker since she was 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她5岁就开始玩扑克牌了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've gotta listen to every word she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说的每一个字都要注意听
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Is Tony Randall dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你好 - 喜剧泰斗东尼蓝道死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, why? - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么会   - 我没听说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:51.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he may be now because I think I hit him with my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:51.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可能已经死了 我好像刚刚开车撞到他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- My God. Really? - No, that's bluffing. Lesson number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我的天，真的吗  - 假的，第一课，这就是唬人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:09:58.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:09:58.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything you hear at a poker game is pure crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:02.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在扑克牌桌上听到的 通通不可以当真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Nice earrings. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好漂亮的耳环 - 谢…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Girls, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位小姐，坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Um, Aunt Iris, this is Phoebe, and Rachel... - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 爱瑞丝阿姨，这是菲比、瑞秋… - 好了，好了，好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I am parked at a meter. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们开始吧 这里停车要计时收费
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, could we please, please, listen to anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，拜托 我们能不能听点别的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna pay for that tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guess what, guess what, guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们猜，你们猜，你们猜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:11:01.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, okay. The fifth dentist caved, and now they're all recommending Trident?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:11:01.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，第五个牙医投降了 他们开始推荐薄荷口香糖了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:10.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:10.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是，是我的面试
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She loved me. She absolutely loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她好喜欢我，超级喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We talked for, like, two and a half hours. We have the same taste in clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们谈了两个半小时 我们的衣着品味相同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I went to camp with her cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟她表妹还去过同一个夏令营
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, oh, the job is perfect. I can do this. I can do this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这工作太完美了 我可以做得很好，一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God. And she told the funniest story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且她的故事超好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, great, you'll tell us and we'll laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好极了，你说出来 我们一定会笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's play poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始玩扑克牌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, listen, we talked about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我们谈过了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:36.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and if you don't want to play, we completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:36.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们不想玩 我们可以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:39.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, yes. We can play some other game. Like, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:39.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我们可以玩别的 像是，不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Pictionary?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比手画脚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:44.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very funny. Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:44.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好笑，很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:46.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we'd like to give poker another try. Shall we, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:46.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们再给扑克牌一次机会吧 好吗，两位小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BOTH: Yes, I think we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好啊 - 好啊，没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, do you want me to shuffle those?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我洗牌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. That's okay. You know what? I'm gonna give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了，没关系 我来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:54.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: All right. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:54.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吧 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:08.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Pheebs owes 7.50. Monica, you owe $10.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:08.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比欠7块5 摩妮卡，你欠10块
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, Rachel, you owe 15 big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，你欠15块
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for teaching us "Crossed-eyed Mary."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你教我们唱 《斗鸡眼玛莉》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:17.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, we gotta play that other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:17.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个我们一定要放出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, here's my 7.50, but I think you should know that this money is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}7块5拿去 你们要知道，这钱被诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Oh, I cursed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 哦，诅咒是我下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So now bad things will happen to he who spends it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管是谁花掉的 都会有倒霉的事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's all right, I'll take it. Bad things happen to me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:33.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系，给我吧 反正我一直都很倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This way, I can break them up with a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样我就可以用电影解除咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:42.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So that just leaves the big Green poker machine, who owes 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:42.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在只剩下葛林扑克牌机 她欠我们15块
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm, oh, it's so typical:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是标准的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Ooh, I'm a man. Ooh, I have a penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我是个男人，我是带把的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, I have to win money to exert my power over women."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是要赢钱 来显示出驾．驭女性的权力〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? This is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道吗？我们还没玩完
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:13:00.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We will play you again. And we will win and you will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:13:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会再来找你们 我们会赢 你们会输
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you will beg and we will laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们会求饶，我们会讥笑你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:04.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we will take every last dime you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:04.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们所有的钱 都会被我们赢光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:07.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you will hate yourselves forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:07.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再一辈子 痛恨你们自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm. Kind of stepped on my point there, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你把我想讲的话都说光了，摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you gals wanna hand over your money now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱你们要现在付吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That way, we don't have to go through the formality of actually playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样我们就可以 直接跳过玩牌的仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's fine. We'll see who has the last laugh there, monkey boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系，我们来看看 最后笑的人是谁，猴孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, are we done with the chitchat? Are we ready to play serious poker?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聊天聊完了没有 要不要认真打牌啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:39.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you guys, look. The one-eyed jack follows me wherever I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:39.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家快看 单眼杰克的眼睛一直跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, okay. Serious poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，好好打一场扑克牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:46.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Excuse me. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:46.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思，你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:47.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:47.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you wanna go to the bathroom or do you wanna play poker?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是来上厕所 还是来玩扑克牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right, well, I'm gonna order a pizza. - Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好，我打电话叫披萨外卖 - 不行，不行，不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm waiting to hear from that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在等那工作的面试结果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the store closes at 9, so you can eat then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}百货公司9点关 你那时候再吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's fine. I'll just have a Tic Tac to hold me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系，我吃薄荷糖先垫肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:11.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Cincinnati. No blinds. Everybody ante.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:11.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，辛辛那提扑克规则 不下盲注，大家先下注
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your money's mine, Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的钱就是我的，葛林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your fly's open, Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的拉链开着，盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, you know what I just realized?
